 "subtitles": [
  {
   "start": 0.35,
   "end": 2.62,
   "text": "He rose from an artillery officer",
   "y": 1410
  },
  {
   "start": 2.62,
   "end": 5.64,
   "text": "to become the most feared\nruler in Europe.",
   "y": 1410
  },
  {
   "start": 5.89,
   "end": 7.72,
   "text": "Napoleon Bonaparte crowned himself",
   "y": 1410
  },
  {
   "start": 7.72,
   "end": 10.47,
   "text": "Emperor of the French\nin 1804.",
   "y": 1410
  },
  {
   "start": 10.72,
   "end": 12.64,
   "text": "His armies won\nextraordinary victories,",
   "y": 1410
  },
  {
   "start": 12.64,
   "end": 14.94,
   "text": "and his empire\nreshaped the continent.",
   "y": 1410
  },
  {
   "start": 15.19,
   "end": 17.23,
   "text": "But Napoleon wanted more.",
   "y": 1410
  },
  {
   "start": 17.48,
   "end": 19.59,
   "text": "In 1812, he invaded Russia",
   "y": 1410
  },
  {
   "start": 19.59,
   "end": 21.7,
   "text": "with a vast\nmultinational army.",
   "y": 1410
  },
  {
   "start": 21.95,
   "end": 23.1,
   "text": "He reached Moscow,",
   "y": 1410
  },
  {
   "start": 23.1,
   "end": 26.17,
   "text": "only to find much of the city\nburning.",
   "y": 1410
  },
  {
   "start": 26.42,
   "end": 28.47,
   "text": "Then came the retreat.",
   "y": 1410
  },
  {
   "start": 28.72,
   "end": 29.88,
   "text": "Hunger, disease, exhaustion,",
   "y": 1410
  },
  {
   "start": 29.88,
   "end": 32.22,
   "text": "and bitter cold\ndevastated his forces.",
   "y": 1410
  },
  {
   "start": 32.47,
   "end": 34.15,
   "text": "His enemies united.",
   "y": 1410
  },
  {
   "start": 34.4,
   "end": 36.12,
   "text": "In 1814, Napoleon abdicated",
   "y": 1410
  },
  {
   "start": 36.12,
   "end": 38.26,
   "text": "and was exiled to Elba.",
   "y": 1410
  },
  {
   "start": 38.51,
   "end": 40.46,
   "text": "He returned the following year",
   "y": 1410
  },
  {
   "start": 40.46,
   "end": 42.01,
   "text": "for one final gamble.",
   "y": 1410
  },
  {
   "start": 42.26,
   "end": 45.03,
   "text": "At Waterloo,\nhis army was defeated.",
   "y": 1410
  },
  {
   "start": 45.28,
   "end": 49.09,
   "text": "This time, exile meant\na remote island in the Atlantic:",
   "y": 1410
  },
  {
   "start": 49.09,
   "end": 49.85,
   "text": "Saint Helena.",
   "y": 1410
  },
  {
   "start": 50.1,
   "end": 52.53,
   "text": "Napoleon died there\nin 1821.",
   "y": 1410
  },
  {
   "start": 52.78,
   "end": 54.72,
   "text": "He conquered kingdoms,\nchanged Europe,",
   "y": 1410
  },
  {
   "start": 54.72,
   "end": 56.28,
   "text": "and became a legend.",
   "y": 1410
  },
  {
   "start": 56.53,
   "end": 58.45,
   "text": "But he could not conquer",
   "y": 1410
  },
  {
   "start": 58.45,
   "end": 60.75,
   "text": "the consequences\nof his own ambition.",
   "y": 1410
  }
 ],
